  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 680934,
    "RowId": 37700,
    "Text": "The researchers should be just ahead.<<key>>There─the building to the northeast."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 681026,
    "RowId": 37701,
    "Text": "So, ordinarily harmless creatures have grown savage..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 681094,
    "RowId": 37702,
    "Text": "Don't know what's got them riled up, but I'll take down any that thinks to try me!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 681190,
    "RowId": 37703,
    "Text": "Right, let's hunt our fill!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 681230,
    "RowId": 37704,
    "Text": "Look! Someone's in trouble!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 681270,
    "RowId": 37705,
    "Text": "Yaaargh! Taste my axe!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 681306,
    "RowId": 37706,
    "Text": "These animals are usually so docile..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 681358,
    "RowId": 37707,
    "Text": "You really are famous."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 681394,
    "RowId": 37708,
    "Text": "And for good reason, as you'll soon see for yourself."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 681458,
    "RowId": 37709,
    "Text": "Haha! Quite an interesting contraption you've got here!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 681526,
    "RowId": 37710,
    "Text": "Is that our petitioner? Let's go and have a chat."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 681586,
    "RowId": 37711,
    "Text": "I'll handle this!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 681614,
    "RowId": 37712,
    "Text": "Hmph. Is that all?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 681646,
    "RowId": 37713,
    "Text": "These claw marks... I've seen their like before."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 681706,
    "RowId": 37714,
    "Text": "Feathers... But did they belong to the predator or the prey?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 681778,
    "RowId": 37715,
    "Text": "Still fresh. Whatever this beast, it cannot be far."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 681842,
    "RowId": 37716,
    "Text": "It's starting to feel like a proper hunt!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 681894,
    "RowId": 37717,
    "Text": "So, how do you prefer our prey? Roasted or raw?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 681954,
    "RowId": 37718,
    "Text": "You presume it's even safe to eat..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 682002,
    "RowId": 37719,
    "Text": "Do you suppose they're upset we disturbed their home?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 682066,
    "RowId": 37720,
    "Text": "Who knows? But if they're spoiling for a fight, then they've got one!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 682146,
    "RowId": 37721,
    "Text": "Let's head back and report what we've found."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 682202,
    "RowId": 37722,
    "Text": "Talk all you like, bird! I'm going to have the last laugh!<<key>>Oh, I'm going to enjoy sinking my teeth into you!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 682326,
    "RowId": 37723,
    "Text": "I'm going to have the last laugh!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 682370,
    "RowId": 37724,
    "Text": "Gah! Shut up already, you blasted bird!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 682422,
    "RowId": 37725,
    "Text": "Shut up already! Shut up already!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 682466,
    "RowId": 37726,
    "Text": "I've never seen such an enormous colibri..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 682522,
    "RowId": 37727,
    "Text": "Not good... Quickly, gather together!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 682570,
    "RowId": 37728,
    "Text": "I've got you!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 682594,
    "RowId": 37729,
    "Text": "Spread out, everyone."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 682626,
    "RowId": 37730,
    "Text": "Hmph, that was hardly a tickle!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 682670,
    "RowId": 37731,
    "Text": "Hardly a tickle!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 682698,
    "RowId": 37732,
    "Text": "We have you now, you loud-mouthed bastard! "
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 682754,
    "RowId": 37733,
    "Text": "Loud-mouthed bastard!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 682786,
    "RowId": 37734,
    "Text": "Search for signs of your prey"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 682826,
    "RowId": 37735,
    "Text": "Head toward the building to the northeast"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 682878,
    "RowId": 37736,
    "Text": "Rescue the hard-pressed surveyor"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 682922,
    "RowId": 37737,
    "Text": "Speak with the hard-pressed surveyor"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 682970,
    "RowId": 37738,
    "Text": "Use the transport device"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 683006,
    "RowId": 37739,
    "Text": "Speak with the concerned researcher"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 683054,
    "RowId": 37740,
    "Text": "Defeat the rampaging animals"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 683094,
    "RowId": 37741,
    "Text": "Survey the area for signs of your prey"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 683146,
    "RowId": 37742,
    "Text": "Defeat the enraged animals"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 683186,
    "RowId": 37743,
    "Text": "Speak with the concerned researcher"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 683234,
    "RowId": 37744,
    "Text": "Defeat the giant colibri"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 683270,
    "RowId": 37745,
    "Text": "Save your comrades"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 683302,
    "RowId": 37746,
    "Text": "Defeat the giant colibri"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 683338,
    "RowId": 37747,
    "Text": "Come on, let's pick up the creature's trail!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 683394,
    "RowId": 37748,
    "Text": "Continue surveying the area for signs of your prey"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 683458,
    "RowId": 37749,
    "Text": "Continue surveying the area once more for signs of your prey"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 683530,
    "RowId": 37750,
    "Text": "Clip the wings of the giant colibri"
  },
