  {
    "RowOffset": 684166,
    "RowId": 37800,
    "Text": "Arrive in the cloven crystal square"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 684214,
    "RowId": 37801,
    "Text": "Clear the cloven crystal square"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 684258,
    "RowId": 37802,
    "Text": "Arrive at the bloodied barbican"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 684302,
    "RowId": 37803,
    "Text": "Clear the bloodied barbican"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 684342,
    "RowId": 37804,
    "Text": "Arrive in the Carnelian Courtyard"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 684386,
    "RowId": 37805,
    "Text": "Clear the Carnelian Courtyard"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 684426,
    "RowId": 37806,
    "Text": "Hurry, Golbez! The city is already overrun!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 684482,
    "RowId": 37807,
    "Text": "They <i>knew</i> we were elsewhere. Cowards!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 684542,
    "RowId": 37808,
    "Text": "That they command such terrible beasts bodes ill... We've no time to lose!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 684630,
    "RowId": 37809,
    "Text": "This one is dangerous. Have care, Golbez."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 684682,
    "RowId": 37810,
    "Text": "That they command such terrible beasts bodes ill... We've no time to lose!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 684770,
    "RowId": 37811,
    "Text": "No, not the soldiers... Hells take them!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 684822,
    "RowId": 37812,
    "Text": "悪党どもを一掃するぞ、ゴルベーザ！"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 684886,
    "RowId": 37813,
    "Text": "奴が首魁だな……逃がさんッ！"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 684942,
    "RowId": 37814,
    "Text": "ここは兵たちに任せよう。\n俺たちは先へ！"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 685014,
    "RowId": 37815,
    "Text": "俺もメモリアの力を解放すべきか……\nいや、それは奥の手だ。"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 685114,
    "RowId": 37816,
    "Text": "さすがは英雄ゴルベーザ！\n俺も負けてられん！"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 685194,
    "RowId": 37817,
    "Text": "我ら二人に、敵う者などいない！"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 685250,
    "RowId": 37818,
    "Text": "Such destruction... If only we had returned sooner..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 685314,
    "RowId": 37819,
    "Text": "First the villages, and now the capital... Nothing is exempt from their avarice."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 685406,
    "RowId": 37820,
    "Text": "I daresay we'll be faster if we split up."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 685458,
    "RowId": 37821,
    "Text": "この外道どもが……！"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 685502,
    "RowId": 37822,
    "Text": "お前たちの好きにはさせん！"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 685554,
    "RowId": 37823,
    "Text": "You are not worthy of your gift!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 685598,
    "RowId": 37824,
    "Text": "Who dares trespass in Lord Golbez's domain?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 685654,
    "RowId": 37825,
    "Text": "To me, O beacons of the Dark..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 685698,
    "RowId": 37826,
    "Text": "O Darkness, show them their folly!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 685746,
    "RowId": 37827,
    "Text": "Fools! There is no escape!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 685786,
    "RowId": 37828,
    "Text": "You cannot fend against what you cannot see!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 685842,
    "RowId": 37829,
    "Text": "Behold, the power of Darkness!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 685886,
    "RowId": 37830,
    "Text": "So be it. I will fight you with all my strength."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 685946,
    "RowId": 37831,
    "Text": "You are even stronger than before..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 685994,
    "RowId": 37832,
    "Text": "Even so, I'll not be bested. Not this day."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 686050,
    "RowId": 37833,
    "Text": "Come to your senses, Golbez! Remember who you are!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 686114,
    "RowId": 37834,
    "Text": "Do not give in to the darkness!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 686158,
    "RowId": 37835,
    "Text": "Aether to fortify my blade..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 686198,
    "RowId": 37836,
    "Text": "I need power. Light or Dark, it matters not!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 686254,
    "RowId": 37837,
    "Text": "You've weathered this before. Let's see how you fare now!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 686322,
    "RowId": 37838,
    "Text": "Even if I must blacken my heart, I will prevail!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 686382,
    "RowId": 37839,
    "Text": "It's over, my friend!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 686414,
    "RowId": 37840,
    "Text": "Still you stand... I'm not surprised."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 686462,
    "RowId": 37841,
    "Text": "Such savagery ill suits you."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 686502,
    "RowId": 37842,
    "Text": "No... I can't afford to..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 686542,
    "RowId": 37843,
    "Text": "Prepare yourself!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 686570,
    "RowId": 37844,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 686582,
    "RowId": 37845,
    "Text": "What have we here? Come to play hero, are you?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 686642,
    "RowId": 37846,
    "Text": "クソッ！\u3000ここは一旦、退くぞ……！"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 686706,
    "RowId": 37847,
    "Text": "How...? How could I..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 686742,
    "RowId": 37848,
    "Text": "Behold, the true power of memoria!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 686790,
    "RowId": 37849,
    "Text": "You find a discarded memoria crystal, and it suddenly begins to glow..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 686874,
    "RowId": 37850,
    "Text": "Go forth, my pets, and feast on their flesh!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 686930,
    "RowId": 37851,
    "Text": "Bested by Golbez and Durante both... It seems I...underestimated you..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 687014,
    "RowId": 37852,
    "Text": "Such...strength..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 687046,
    "RowId": 37853,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
