  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 687610,
    "RowId": 37900,
    "Text": "Defeat the Infernal Shadow"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 687650,
    "RowId": 37901,
    "Text": "With me, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 687690,
    "RowId": 37902,
    "Text": "His flames grow hotter...\nWatch yourself!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 687746,
    "RowId": 37903,
    "Text": "Shit! I can't move!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 687778,
    "RowId": 37904,
    "Text": "<split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>, buy me some time!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 687826,
    "RowId": 37905,
    "Text": "This...won't...hold me!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 687862,
    "RowId": 37906,
    "Text": "My thanks."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 687886,
    "RowId": 37907,
    "Text": "...On your guard.\nHe means to unleash hell!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 687946,
    "RowId": 37908,
    "Text": "すべてを潰すつもりか！？\nあのまま、振り下ろさせるわけには……！"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 688054,
    "RowId": 37909,
    "Text": "<split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 688082,
    "RowId": 37910,
    "Text": "Still in the fight?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 688114,
    "RowId": 37911,
    "Text": "These blades, they're feeding him power...\nBut not if we break them!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 688198,
    "RowId": 37912,
    "Text": "Still with me, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>?\nLet's finish this!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 688266,
    "RowId": 37913,
    "Text": "Stay sharp─you can evade the worst of his blows!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 688330,
    "RowId": 37914,
    "Text": "Well done.\nNow it's your turn!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 688374,
    "RowId": 37915,
    "Text": "<split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>, no!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 688406,
    "RowId": 37916,
    "Text": "I've failed..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 688434,
    "RowId": 37917,
    "Text": "There's too damn many!\nWe cannot rely on steel alone..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 688506,
    "RowId": 37918,
    "Text": "Just a few more, <split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>!\nWe leave none standing!"
  },
